## Tech Stack Decisions

| Layer | Technology | Reason |
|-------|-----------|--------|
| **Frontend** | React + Vite + Three.js (react-three-fiber) | Modern, fast, 3D STL viewing in browser |
| **Backend API** | FastAPI (Python) | Async, auto-docs, tight fit with all Python CAD/FEA tools |
| **LLM** | Groq API (Llama 3 / Mixtral) | Free tier, fast, you've used it before |
| **Validation** | Pydantic v2 | Deterministic schema validation |
| **CAD Engine** | CadQuery | Pure Python, no GUI, exports STEP/STL |
| **Meshing** | Gmsh (official Python API) | Industry standard, parametric mesh control |
| **FEA Solver** | CalculiX (`ccx`) | Free, robust, Windows binaries available |
| **Topology Opt** | Custom SIMP (NumPy/SciPy) | Based on DTU TopOpt 88-line code, educational + demonstrable |
| **Reconstruction** | Open3D + SciPy | Surface extraction from density field |
| **3D Viewer** | STLLoader via react-three-fiber | Native STL support in browser |
| **Report** | ReportLab / Matplotlib | PDF generation with charts |

