### Phase 6: Topology Optimization
> **Goal**: SIMP-based material distribution optimization

#### [NEW] backend/optimization/simp.py
SIMP algorithm (based on DTU 88-line code, adapted):
- Element density array (0→void, 1→solid)
- Penalization factor (p=3)
- Compliance minimization OR mass minimization
- Volume constraint enforcement
- Optimality criteria (OC) update scheme

#### [NEW] backend/optimization/sensitivity.py
Sensitivity analysis:
- Compute dc/dρ for each element
- Sensitivity filtering (to avoid checkerboard patterns)

#### [NEW] backend/optimization/filters.py
- Density filter (radius-based neighborhood averaging)
- Heaviside projection (sharpen 0/1 boundaries)

#### [NEW] backend/optimization/controller.py
Optimization loop controller:
- Run SIMP iterations
- Check convergence (change in objective < tolerance)
- Apply volume constraint
- Return optimized density field + iteration history

