### Phase 7: CAD Reconstruction + Final Validation
> **Goal**: Optimized density field → clean CAD → validation FEA

#### [NEW] backend/reconstruction/surface_extractor.py
- Marching cubes on density field (threshold at 0.5)
- Extract isosurface as triangle mesh

#### [NEW] backend/reconstruction/mesh_cleaner.py
- Laplacian smoothing
- Mesh simplification (reduce triangle count)
- Remove small disconnected components

#### [NEW] backend/reconstruction/cad_rebuilder.py
- Convert cleaned mesh to STL
- Optionally fit geometric primitives (planes, cylinders) via RANSAC
- Export as STEP/STL

#### Validation FEA:
- Re-run full FEA pipeline on reconstructed geometry
- Compare results against constraints
- If FAIL → loop back to optimization with modified constraints

